1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:03,308
ZERO forgot his mom's birthday.

2
00:00:03,608 --> 00:00:05,480
It's tomorrow.

3
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,027
She lives on the other side

4
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:12,858
of the country.

5
00:00:13,158 --> 00:00:15,078
So how is that even possible?

6
00:00:25,478 --> 00:00:27,648
Between this counter and her front

7
00:00:27,648 --> 00:00:29,690
door, something enormous happens

8
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,286
while the country sleeps.

9
00:00:31,586 --> 00:00:32,546
A truck.

10
00:00:32,946 --> 00:00:33,906
A plane.

11
00:00:34,106 --> 00:00:36,192
A building that sorts more than four

12
00:00:36,192 --> 00:00:38,162
hundred thousand packages an hour.

13
00:00:38,362 --> 00:00:41,386
Tonight, ZERO is staying awake to see it.

14
00:00:42,536 --> 00:00:43,808
Three questions.

15
00:00:44,108 --> 00:00:45,878
How does the system know where

16
00:00:45,878 --> 00:00:46,940
this box is going?

17
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,680
Who pays for a plane to fly

18
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,640
through the night?

19
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,092
And what happens when

20
00:00:51,092 --> 00:00:52,244
something goes wrong?

21
00:00:52,544 --> 00:00:54,680
Because tonight, something will.

22
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:58,502
To ZERO, it's a gift.

23
00:00:59,352 --> 00:01:01,296
To the system, it's this.

24
00:01:01,596 --> 00:01:03,468
A barcode.

25
00:01:03,618 --> 00:01:04,698
An address,

26
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:06,670
a service level,

27
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:08,642
a deadline.

28
00:01:09,542 --> 00:01:12,003
Every time the box passes a scanner,

29
00:01:12,003 --> 00:01:14,054
the system learns where it is.

30
00:01:14,954 --> 00:01:16,898
That's what tracking really is.

31
00:01:17,798 --> 00:01:20,150
Not a GPS inside your box.

32
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:22,922
A trail of scans.

33
00:01:24,172 --> 00:01:26,317
From the counter, the box goes to a

34
00:01:26,317 --> 00:01:28,156
truck heading for the airport.

35
00:01:29,056 --> 00:01:30,928
It's raining.

36
00:01:31,228 --> 00:01:33,100
The box doesn't care.

37
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,372
ZERO does.

38
00:01:36,622 --> 00:01:38,710
Somebody is paying for this truck,

39
00:01:39,010 --> 00:01:40,882
this driver,

40
00:01:41,032 --> 00:01:42,904
and this fuel.

41
00:01:43,854 --> 00:01:45,726
Keep that in mind.
